hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1566","Bundar told us, Abu Asim told us, Ja’far bin Yahya told us, my uncle Amara bin Thawban told us, on the authority of Ata’ bin Abi Rabah, on the authority of Ibn Abbas, he said: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “The best of you are those who are skilled in prayer.”"
